 calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-prose);\">需訂正｜答案：B</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">HOCH₂COOH 同時具有連接在飽和碳上的 –OH 與 –COOH。羧基本身的 –OH 不另算為醇類羥基。</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">2. 下列關於沸點的敘述，哪些正確？（多選）</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-state=\"checked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_f9_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span data-state=\"checked\" class=\"CheckMark-kWHPnc\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\" data-disabled=\"\"></span></button><label for=\"_r_f9_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 乙醇通常比相近分子量的醚有較高沸點</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fa_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fa_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 所有含氧有機物都能在純物質分子間形成氫鍵</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fb_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fb_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 碳鏈變長可能提高分散力</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fc_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fc_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 沸點只取決於官能基種類</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-prose);\">需訂正｜答案：A、C</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">乙醇可形成分子間氫鍵；碳鏈變長也常使分散力增強。沸點受多種因素共同影響。</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">3. 某物質能產生銀鏡反應，但不與碳酸氫鈉產生明顯 CO₂。在以下選項中最可能是哪一個？</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-state=\"checked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fe_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span data-state=\"checked\" class=\"CheckMark-kWHPnc\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\" data-disabled=\"\"></span></button><label for=\"_r_fe_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 乙酸</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_ff_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_ff_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 乙醛</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fg_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fg_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 丙酮</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fh_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fh_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 乙酸乙酯</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-prose);\">需訂正｜答案：B</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">乙醛能被溫和氧化劑氧化，通常可產生銀鏡；乙酸則能與碳酸氫鹽反應產生 CO₂。</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">4. CH₃CH₂CH₂COOCH₃ 的正確名稱為何？</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-state=\"checked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fj_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span data-state=\"checked\" class=\"CheckMark-kWHPnc\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\" data-disabled=\"\"></span></button><label for=\"_r_fj_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 丁酸甲酯</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fk_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fk_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 丙酸乙酯</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fl_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fl_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 甲酸丁酯</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fm_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fm_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>D. 丁醚甲烷</span></label></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"--smoothing-background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); border-radius: var(--dil-radius-md); --w-box-gutter-block-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-block-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-end: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); --w-box-gutter-inline-start: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-block: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); padding-inline: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 3); background-color: var(--color-surface-secondary); gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 1);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\" style=\"color: var(--color-text-success);\">正確｜答案：A</p><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-size=\"sm\">–COO– 左側含羰基碳在內共有四個碳，屬丁酸部分；右側是甲基，因此為丁酸甲酯。</p></div></div><div class=\"Divider-aIXBUs\" data-d-component=\"divider\" style=\"--divider-color: var(--color-border-subtle); --divider-size: 1px;\"></div><div class=\"Box-JYjgF4\" data-d-component=\"box\" data-d-direction=\"col\" style=\"gap: calc(var(--spacing, 0.25rem) * 2);\"><p class=\"TextBase-kDAqPL Text-dOmvsS\" data-d-text-flow=\"\" data-d-component=\"text\" data-d-weight=\"medium\">5. 關於酚、醇、胺與醯胺，哪些敘述正確？（多選）</p><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"true\" data-state=\"checked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fo_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"><span data-state=\"checked\" class=\"CheckMark-kWHPnc\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\" data-disabled=\"\"></span></button><label for=\"_r_fo_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>A. 酚的 –OH 直接連接芳香環</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fp_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fp_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>B. 一般醇比酚更容易與 NaOH 反應</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" class=\"Round-hHfb6x Container-tuMRJ8\" data-disabled=\"\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"checkbox\" aria-checked=\"false\" data-state=\"unchecked\" value=\"on\" class=\"Checkbox-HGrYIk\" id=\"_r_fq_\" data-d-component=\"checkbox\" data-disabled=\"\" disabled=\"\"></button><label for=\"_r_fq_\" class=\"Label-ormz6U RoundLabel-zdjApa\"><span>C. 一般脂肪族胺通常具有鹼性</span></label></div><div data-has-label=\"\" data-orientation=\"left\" cla